msgid "Kp-index"
msgstr ""

#: ../contents/ui/AirAndSolarItem.qml
msgid "Power"
msgstr ""

#: ../contents/ui/AirAndSolarItem.qml
msgid "Health index"
msgstr ""

#: ../contents/ui/AirAndSolarItem.qml
msgid "Details"
msgstr ""

#: ../contents/ui/AirAndSolarItem.qml
msgid ""
"The Kp-index is a measure of geomagnetic activity. It ranges from 0 to 9, with higher values indicating more intense geomagnetic storms. A Kp-index of 0-3 is considered quiet, 4-5 is unsettled, 6-7 "
"is active, and 8-9 is storm-level activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../contents/ui/AirAndSolarItem.qml
msgid ""
"The health index is a measure of how the solar conditions combined with pressure changes may affect human health. It ranges from 0 to 10+, with higher values indicating more unfavorable conditions "
"for health. A health index of 0-2 is considered comfortable, 3-5 is moderate, and 6+ is unfavorable."
msgstr ""

